OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash after police
OL,4,Apursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and two women have been
OL,7,Finjured in a crash that followed a
OL,8,Fpolice pursuit near
OL,9,FStratford-upon-Avon.
OL,11,FOfficers tried to stop a black Audi on
OL,12,FBirmingham Road shortly before 17:30
OL,13,FBST on Monday but the driver failed to
OL,14,Fpull over, Warwickshire Police said.
OL,16,FA pursuit began and 15 minutes later
OL,17,Fthe Audi crashed into a white Ford
OL,18,FPuma, the force added, with the Audi's
OL,19,Fmale driver confirmed dead at the scene
OL,20,Fby paramedics.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
